g\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"3ed0e3e918567403b7d4bca3d1b7702f\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"a2301c52162e4eed9fbc4235f04c9113\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','3ed0e3e918567403b7d4bca3d1b7702f','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 13:47:23','2025-03-13 13:47:23',802,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'The term \'rag\' could refer to various concepts depending on the context, such as a piece of old cloth, a type of music (ragtime), or an acronym in technology or business. Please provide more context or specify the area you are interested in for a more detailed answer.','{\"client_key\": \"a2301c52162e4eed9fbc4235f04c9113\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','3ed0e3e918567403b7d4bca3d1b7702f','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 13:49:53','2025-03-13 13:49:53',803,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag发展过程\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:10:16','2025-03-13 14:10:16',804,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'关于RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）的发展过程，目前没有详细的信息能够提供。通常，RAG是一种结合了信息检索和生成模型的技术，旨在通过从外部知识库中检索相关信息来增强生成模型的回答能力。其发展过程可能涉及到自然语言处理、机器学习和信息检索领域的多项技术进步。','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:10:31','2025-03-13 14:10:31',805,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag解决的问题\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:12:26','2025-03-13 14:12:26',806,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）解决的问题主要是生成模型在回答复杂问题时的局限性。传统的生成模型可能缺乏足够的上下文或事实知识来生成准确的回答，而RAG通过从大型知识库中检索相关信息来增强生成模型的能力，从而提高回答的准确性和相关性。','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:13:16','2025-03-13 14:13:16',807,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"如何增强的\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:14:39','2025-03-13 14:14:39',808,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'RAG通过结合信息检索和生成模型来增强生成能力。具体来说，它在生成回答之前先从大型知识库中检索相关信息，然后将这些信息与生成模型结合，以提高回答的准确性和上下文相关性。这种方法使得生成模型能够利用外部知识库中的丰富信息，从而在回答复杂问题时表现得更加出色。','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:16:08','2025-03-13 14:16:08',809,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag的初级阶段\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:38:39','2025-03-13 14:38:39',810,'null'),(1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"tool_key\": \"9\", \"output\": \"\\u5728RAG\\uff08Retrieval-Augmented Generation\\uff09\\u7684\\u521d\\u7ea7\\u9636\\u6bb5\\uff0c\\u901a\\u5e38\\u6d89\\u53ca\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6b65\\u9aa4\\uff1a\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u548c\\u751f\\u6210\\u3002\\n\\n1. **\\u68c0\\u7d22\\uff08Retrieval\\uff09**\\uff1a\\u5728\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u9636\\u6bb5\\uff0c\\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u4f1a\\u4ece\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u5927\\u578b\\u7684\\u6587\\u6863\\u96c6\\u5408\\u4e2d\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u51fa\\u4e0e\\u8f93\\u5165\\u67e5\\u8be2\\u76f8\\u5173\\u7684\\u6587\\u6863\\u6216\\u7247\\u6bb5\\u3002\\u8fd9\\u901a\\u5e38\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u6280\\u672f\\uff0c\\u5982\\u57fa\\u4e8e\\u5411\\u91cf\\u7684\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u6a21\\u578b\\uff08\\u4f8b\\u5982\\uff0cBM25\\u6216Dense Passage Retrieval\\uff09\\u3002\\u76ee\\u7684\\u662f\\u627e\\u5230\\u6700\\u76f8\\u5173\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u4fbf\\u5728\\u751f\\u6210\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u3002\\n\\n2. **\\u751f\\u6210\\uff08Generation\\uff09**\\uff1a\\u5728\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u5230\\u76f8\\u5173\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u540e\\uff0c\\u751f\\u6210\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u4f1a\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u751f\\u6210\\u6a21\\u578b\\uff08\\u5982GPT\\u6216BERT\\u53d8\\u4f53\\uff09\\u6765\\u751f\\u6210\\u6700\\u7ec8\\u7684\\u56de\\u7b54\\u6216\\u6587\\u672c\\u3002\\u8fd9\\u4e00\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u7684\\u751f\\u6210\\u662f\\u57fa\\u4e8e\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u5230\\u7684\\u4e0a\\u4e0b\\u6587\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u63d0\\u9ad8\\u56de\\u7b54\\u7684\\u51c6\\u786e\\u6027\\u548c\\u76f8\\u5173\\u6027\\u3002\\n\\n\\u521d\\u7ea7\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u7684\\u91cd\\u70b9\\u662f\\u786e\\u4fdd\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u5230\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\u8db3\\u591f\\u76f8\\u5173\\u548c\\u5168\\u9762\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u652f\\u6301\\u751f\\u6210\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u7684\\u9ad8\\u8d28\\u91cf\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u3002\", \"serialized\": {\"name\": \"knowledge_9\", \"description\": \"\\u6d4b\\u8bd5ragflow:\"}, \"input_str\": \"RAG\\u7684\\u521d\\u7ea7\\u9636\\u6bb5\"}','{\"run_id\": \"eb2ebf9889b14ca589fb0c93310fdae0\"}','end','knowledge','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'','Tool input: \n\nRAG的初级阶段\n\n\n\nTool output: \n\n在RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）的初级阶段，通常涉及两个主要步骤：检索和生成。\n\n1. **检索（Retrieval）**：在这个阶段，系统会从一个大型的文档集合中检索出与输入查询相关的文档或片段。这通常使用信息检索技术，如基于向量的检索模型（例如，BM25或Dense Passage Retrieval）。目的是找到最相关的信息，以便在生成阶段使用。\n\n2. **生成（Generation）**：在检索到相关信息后，生成阶段会使用生成模型（如GPT或BERT变体）来生成最终的回答或文本。这一阶段的生成是基于检索到的上下文信息，以提高回答的准确性和相关性。\n\n初级阶段的重点是确保检索到的信息足够相关和全面，以支持生成阶段的高质量输出。',NULL,NULL,'2025-03-13 14:38:49','2025-03-13 14:38:49',811,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）的初级阶段包括两个主要步骤：检索和生成。在检索阶段，系统从大型文档集合中检索与输入查询相关的文档或片段，通常使用信息检索技术，如BM25或Dense Passage Retrieval。生成阶段则使用生成模型（如GPT或BERT变体）基于检索到的上下文信息生成最终回答或文本。初级阶段的关键在于确保检索信息的相关性和全面性，以支持生成阶段的高质量输出。','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 14:39:18','2025-03-13 14:39:18',812,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag发展\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 15:08:58','2025-03-13 15:08:58',813,'null'),(1,0,1,NULL,NULL,'关于RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）的发展，目前没有详细的文档信息能够提供。通常，RAG是一种结合了信息检索和生成模型的技术，旨在通过从外部知识库中检索相关信息来增强生成模型的回答能力。其发展过程可能涉及到自然语言处理、机器学习和信息检索领域的多项技术进步。','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','bot','answer','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 15:37:14','2025-03-13 15:37:14',814,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag发展的具体阶段\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"8b8d6ec61fe34d149656f926c3a2bc63\"}','human','question','0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f','6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c','1',0,0,0,'',NULL,NULL,'','2025-03-13 15:42:37','2025-03-13 15:42:37',815,'null'),(0,0,1,NULL,NULL,'{\"input\": \"rag\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"0dd061d008a8405d9b6d4e7f55df339f\", \"chatId\": \"6d3d9e09183cdb9bf31d6aa8a5aa956c\", \"type\": 5}}','{\"client_key\": \"6285c9b